<h3 align="start" nodeId="2cf5a52cad8f4cfd8783273439240266">一、背景</h3>
<p align="start" nodeId="3fb0d025396245fa82768e6a31a5f5c0">见画布背景</p>
<h3 align="start" nodeId="02f64b37ed274b73a4d7facbd90bba74">二、名词解释</h3>
<p align="start" nodeId="d54d061df1f04cf8a6bab6c1dc34c245"><span color=" ">规则集合</span>：<span color=" ">可选择多个已定义规则执行</span></p>
<h3 align="start" nodeId="8c4d83ff69554c21a9ff5878e9a49abc">三、配置操作指南</h3>
